  "_weaponComment": "The weapon slot is resolved by the engine as a combination, not a single pick. mainHand accepts inv types 13 (one-hand) and 21 (main hand); offHand accepts 13/22 (dual wield), 14 (shield) and 23 (held in off-hand); twoHand accepts 17.",
